		<div style="font-size:13px;display:block;margin-block-end:13px;margin-block-start:13px;margin-inline-end:0px;margin-inline-start:0px;">My question is that if my process writes packets to the file descriptor associated with a tun device, then will these packets be processed by the iptables and the kernel routing tables or will they be dropped if there is no other user space process is responsible for receiving these packets. </div>
