		<div style="font-size:13px;display:block;margin-block-end:13px;margin-block-start:13px;margin-inline-end:0px;margin-inline-start:0px;">Thanks for your response, Waldner.</div>
<div style="font-size:13px;display:block;margin-block-end:13px;margin-block-start:13px;margin-inline-end:0px;margin-inline-start:0px;">In my original case when in which nothing is connected to the tap0, why is the wire leaving tap0 going to the application that should be connected to the tap0 interface, and not to the bridge?  It seems like tap0 has two wires going different ways.  So is the configuration something like this?</div>
