<div style="font-size:13px;display:block;margin-block-end:13px;margin-block-start:13px;margin-inline-end:0px;margin-inline-start:0px;">I have a question about using tap interfaces.  I'm trying to set up a tap interface on a host, where one end will be the network interface for a virtual machine.  On the other side of the interface, I want to read all the outgoing VM traffic and send it to another host (or hosts) which also have VM's and taps running.</div>
