<div style="font-size:13px;display:block;margin-block-end:13px;margin-block-start:13px;margin-inline-end:0px;margin-inline-start:0px;">I have just found in the linux git history that there was a bug in the tun driver:</div>
<div style="font-size:13px;display:block;margin-block-end:13px;margin-block-start:13px;margin-inline-end:0px;margin-inline-start:0px;">commit f271b2cc78f09c93ccd00a2056d3237134bf994c<br>
