<div style="font-size:13px;display:block;margin-block-end:13px;margin-block-start:13px;margin-inline-end:0px;margin-inline-start:0px;">I'm not sure what you mean "reading directly from a network". Isn't that what you do when you use Wireshark or your own pcap/Jpcap program to sniff traffic passing through the interface? That should do what you want.<br>
